//! 🧬️ Transparent dispatch for the OS config mutation vocabularies. Concrete payloads, behavior,
//! and tests live in direct semantic leaves; shared codecs live with their schema. This root only
//! wraps leaf payloads and delegates descriptor registration generated by `dsl::Mutations`.

